xcellence its commitment  to diversity and equity and inclusion  and now that i'm in this position and  knowing that i have mark support to  encourage those principles you know not  only throughout the raiders but  throughout the nfl it just really makes  you know all of i think the work that  that i've done over the few over the  last you know decades much much more  sweeter  and sandra says her family husband and  two kids mean everything to her in  addition to her parents who still live  here and they all help keep her grounded
 

